IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLRECU.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
COPY "COLSTO".
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-ACTION PIC X(16).
01 WS-NEXT PIC X(12).
01 WS-STT-RC PIC X(02).
01 WS-STT-MSG PIC X(80).
01 BK-COL-PROMISE.
   COPY "COLP".
01 BK-COL-ARRANGE.
   COPY "COLAG".

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "COLOP".
01 LS-CASE.
   COPY "COLC".
01 LS-CAPPED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-COL-PARMS LS-CASE LS-CAPPED.
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    IF WS-CFG-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-CFG-ST TO CO-RC
        MOVE "CONFIG MISSING" TO CO-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM UPDATE-PROMISE
    PERFORM UPDATE-ARRANGEMENT
    GOBACK.

UPDATE-PROMISE.
    IF CC-PROMISE-ID OF LS-CASE = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-COL-PROMISE
    MOVE CC-PROMISE-ID OF LS-CASE TO PM-ID
    MOVE "GET" TO OS-OP
    CALL "COLPSTO" USING BK-COL-STO-REQ BK-COL-PROMISE
    IF OS-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF PM-STATUS NOT = "PROPOSED" AND PM-STATUS NOT = "ACCEPTED"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD LS-CAPPED TO PM-PAID
    MOVE CO-TXN-ID TO PM-TXN-REF
    IF PM-PAID >= PM-AMOUNT
        MOVE "FULFILLED" TO PM-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO PM-STATUS
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO PM-UPDATED
    ADD 1 TO PM-VERSION
    MOVE "REWRITE" TO OS-OP
    CALL "COLPSTO" USING BK-COL-STO-REQ BK-COL-PROMISE.

UPDATE-ARRANGEMENT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACTION
    IF CC-ARRANGEMENT-ID OF LS-CASE = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-COL-ARRANGE
    MOVE CC-ARRANGEMENT-ID OF LS-CASE TO AG-ID
    MOVE "GET" TO OS-OP
    CALL "COLGSTO" USING BK-COL-STO-REQ BK-COL-ARRANGE
    IF OS-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF AG-STATUS NOT = "ACTIVE" AND AG-STATUS NOT = "PARTIALLY"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD LS-CAPPED TO AG-PAID
    IF AG-PAID >= AG-TOTAL
        MOVE "FULFILLED" TO AG-STATUS
        MOVE "ARRANGE-DONE" TO WS-ACTION
    ELSE
        MOVE "PARTIALLY" TO AG-STATUS
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO AG-UPDATED
    ADD 1 TO AG-VERSION
    MOVE "REWRITE" TO OS-OP
    CALL "COLGSTO" USING BK-COL-STO-REQ BK-COL-ARRANGE
    IF WS-ACTION = "ARRANGE-DONE"
        CALL "COLST" USING CC-STATUS OF LS-CASE WS-ACTION
            WS-NEXT WS-STT-RC WS-STT-MSG
        IF WS-STT-RC = "00"
            MOVE WS-NEXT TO CC-STATUS OF LS-CASE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
